# The Mind Stone, harnessed: "At the beginning of your end step, exile up to one other target nonland permanent you
# control, then return that card to the battlefield under its owner's control." Three Black Lotuses, Sol Ring and a
# Mox Sapphire cast The Mind Stone and Sicarian Infiltrator (whose Benediction draws a card as it enters) and harness
# the Stone, all on turn 1. At the end step the infinity ability targets the Infiltrator; it is exiled and comes back
# as a new object (CR 400.7), so its enters ability triggers again and Bot1 draws a second card.

